    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "001"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001030050,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "は、はい！　どうかしましたか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000103/1010001030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小さいコーナーだけど、\r\n智代子のバラエティ番組の出演が決まった！",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001030060,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ええっ！？\r\n本当ですか！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000103/1010001030060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。番組のディレクターが\r\n智代子のツイスタを見てくれているらしい",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それで声をかけてもらえたんだ",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001030070,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "う、うわわ……！　すごい、すごい！\r\nど、どうしましょう！？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000103/1010001030070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001030080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "バラエティなんて初めてですっ\r\nチョコアイドルの面白さがついに地上波に……！？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000103/1010001030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "智代子、慌てすぎだ",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001030090,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "す、すみません、嬉しくて……！\r\nでもっ、ビッグチャンスですよね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000103/1010001030090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001030100,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "どんなふうに挑めばいいのか迷います！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000103/1010001030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001030110,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "語尾にチョコってつけるとか……！\r\n番組中、ずっとチョコ食べてるとか……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000103/1010001030110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001030120,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "チョコ色の服を着てるとか……！？\r\nうう、どうしよう……！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000103/1010001030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001030130,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん！\r\nアドバイスをもらえませんか！？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000103/1010001030130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ア、アドバイスか……\r\nそうだな……",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "いつも通りで\r\nいこう！",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "楽しくやろう！",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "元気いっぱいに\r\nいこう！",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いつも通りで\r\nいこう！",
