    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001030140,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "いつも通り……！\r\nいつも通りってなんですか……！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000103/1010001030140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "普段事務所や学校にいる時みたいに\r\n素直で明るい、そのままの智代子でいこうってことだ",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001030150,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "でも、それでいいんでしょうか……？\r\n私、普通ですし……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000103/1010001030150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "自然体がいい。それが一番だ\r\n普段の智代子を見て、先方はオファーしてくれたんだから",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001030160,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そっか……そうですね、そうですよねっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000103/1010001030160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001030170,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんにそう言ってもらえて\r\nちょっと安心してきました",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000103/1010001030170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001030180,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "リラックスして、いつもの私で頑張ってきます！",
