    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000103/1010001030260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001030270,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ファンになりましたって言ってくれた人もいて……\r\n嬉しくて握手もしちゃいました！　えへへ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000103/1010001030270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか\r\nこれからもその気持ちを忘れないように頑張ろうな",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001030280,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……はい！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101000103/1010001030280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（智代子の笑顔は誰かを笑顔にできる\r\nこれからも、楽しんでアイドル活動をやってほしいな）",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "元気いっぱいに\r\nいこう！",
